%description:
A cell in the Indoor Factory scenario of TR 38.901, sub-scenario InF-SL (sparse clutter, low
base station), with the clutter the radio gives by default for it (Table 7.8-7: density 20 %,
height 2 m, size 10 m) and both antennas at 1.5 m, below the clutter. The LOS state is drawn
from the scenario's LOS probability. The UE is 50 m from the base station. The simulation runs.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

**.radio.scenario = "INDOOR_FACTORY_SL"
# clutter-embedded antennas: both below the 2 m clutter height of the scenario's default
*.gnb.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 1.5m
**.dynamicLos = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
